{"_id": "human_resources--employee_feedbac--p--62123", "text": "{\n    \"feedback_id\": \"FB20241027-001\",\n    \"employee_id\": \"EMP12345\",\n    \"feedback_date\": \"2024-10-26\",\n    \"feedback_provider\": \"Sarah Johnson (Team Lead)\",\n    \"feedback_type\": \"informal\",\n    \"comments\": \"Mark has shown a remarkable improvement in his communication during team meetings. He actively listens, articulates his ideas clearly, and encourages others to contribute. This has led to more productive discussions and a noticeable boost in team collaboration. His proactive communication on project updates has also prevented several potential roadblocks. A clear positive impact on project X.\",\n    \"rating\": 5\n}"}
