{"_id": "human_resources--employee_feedbac--p--62865", "text": "{\n    \"feedback_id\": \"FB-2024-10-26-003\",\n    \"employee_id\": \"EMP-12345\",\n    \"feedback_date\": \"2024-10-26\",\n    \"feedback_provider\": \"Sarah Johnson (Manager)\",\n    \"feedback_type\": \"Formal\",\n    \"comments\": \"John demonstrated exceptional leadership during the recent project. He effectively delegated tasks, mentored team members, and proactively addressed challenges. His communication skills are outstanding, and his positive attitude significantly boosted team morale. He consistently exceeds expectations and is a valuable asset to the organization. Specific examples include his handling of the client presentation and his successful resolution of the technical roadblock on Tuesday.\",\n    \"rating\": 5\n}"}
