{"_id": "human_resources--employee_feedbac--p--68896", "text": "{\n    \"feedback_id\": \"FB-2023-11-15-007\",\n    \"employee_id\": \"EMP-102\",\n    \"feedback_date\": \"2023-11-15\",\n    \"feedback_provider\": \"Sarah Johnson\",\n    \"feedback_type\": \"formal\",\n    \"comments\": \"David consistently demonstrates strong communication skills in team meetings and client presentations. He articulates complex ideas clearly and concisely, and actively listens to others' perspectives. A few suggestions could be to incorporate more visual aids into presentations and to practice proactive communication with project updates. Overall, a valuable asset.\",\n    \"rating\": 4\n}"}
